  "info": {
    "name": "CLS-1746-CLS-2008 - Custom Attributes (PREPROD-1, LOCAL ONLY - contains credentials, never commit)",
    "description": "Preprod-1 run of CLS-1746-CLS-2008, driven only through Backoffice and Gateway (VPN required). No direct microservice calls and no guard-secret header - those are local-dev only. Everything it creates is named with the ticket id so it is identifiable and safe for others to ignore. Custom attribute names are ticket-scoped and the two creation steps tolerate an existing configuration, so the collection can be re-run in a shared environment without colliding with other people or with itself.",
